    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fisheye</strong> is a cute and relaxing <strong>photography game</strong>. Take a deep breath and dive to snap pics of marine wildlife in their natural habitat with your ROV!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.poster.avif?t=1743788146\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.webm?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.mp4?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underwater photo safari, your goal is to <strong>explore</strong> the region, fill your database with fish pics, and document their behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and observe your surroundings to catch a hammerhead shark hunting, a mama whale nursing its calf, or a clownfish snuggling in the protection of an anemone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap neat shots and <strong>collect</strong> all your findings in your database!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.poster.avif?t=1743788146\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.webm?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.mp4?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap</strong> striking shots and <strong>discover all</strong> the fish's natural behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> wildlife snapshots and information in your database</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> colorful voxel environments. Marvel at a thriving coral reef, glide through a towering kelp forest, uncover the hidden wonders of a crystal cave, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light <strong>upgrade</strong> system to explore farther and improve your ROV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute fishes</strong>. (Leviathans not included. We\u2019re not trying to trigger your thalassophobia. You\u2019re welcome.)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fisheye</strong> is a cute and relaxing <strong>photography game</strong>. Take a deep breath and dive to snap pics of marine wildlife in their natural habitat with your ROV!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.poster.avif?t=1743788146\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.webm?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/49ba67ebc055e92acb1b6122a2dfb694.mp4?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underwater photo safari, your goal is to <strong>explore</strong> the region, fill your database with fish pics, and document their behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and observe your surroundings to catch a hammerhead shark hunting, a mama whale nursing its calf, or a clownfish snuggling in the protection of an anemone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap neat shots and <strong>collect</strong> all your findings in your database!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.poster.avif?t=1743788146\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.webm?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463530/extras/4b9c07c388d302c5d8491c63648346e8.mp4?t=1743788146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap</strong> striking shots and <strong>discover all</strong> the fish's natural behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> wildlife snapshots and information in your database</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> colorful voxel environments. Marvel at a thriving coral reef, glide through a towering kelp forest, uncover the hidden wonders of a crystal cave, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light <strong>upgrade</strong> system to explore farther and improve your ROV</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute fishes</strong>. (Leviathans not included. We\u2019re not trying to trigger your thalassophobia. You\u2019re welcome.)</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Snap pictures of marine wildlife to fill your database, and explore the ocean with your ROV!",
